# Test-suite build artifacts (2026-08-16). 562 compiled executables were
# TRACKED under rust_tests/ (11 MB), test_modules/ and tests/zer_fail/, because
# the runners build an exe next to each .zer and never removed it — so every
# `make check` rewrote committed files and left the tree dirty. The runners now
# clean up after themselves; these patterns keep any stragglers out of git.
# .zer sources are matched by the negations below, never by these rules.
rust_tests/*
!rust_tests/*.zer
!rust_tests/*.sh
!rust_tests/*.md
!rust_tests/qemu/
test_modules/*
!test_modules/*.zer
!test_modules/*.sh
!test_modules/*.md
tests/zer_fail/*
!tests/zer_fail/*.zer
tests/zer/*
!tests/zer/*.zer
tests/zer_trap/*
!tests/zer_trap/*.zer
tests/zer_gaps/*
!tests/zer_gaps/*.zer
!tests/zer_gaps/*.md
zig_tests/*
!zig_tests/*.zer
!zig_tests/*.sh
!zig_tests/*.md
